    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative journalist. Each level is inspired by a major historical event from the 1920s including the Black Sox Scandal, Prohibition, and the obscene working conditions that inspired Upton Sinclair's <i>The Jungle.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support Your Leads with Photographic Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and photograph <strong>Secret Photos</strong> to support your story and rack up bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique pickups, from the homing Paper Airplane <strong>Flyers</strong> to the shaken <strong>Soda Thrower</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ink-Slingin' Shutterbug</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out multiple foes at once by hucking jars of <strong>Ink</strong> or stun groups with your <strong>Camera Flash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stand up to the Big Cheeses of BigCity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against challenging boss fights at the end of every third stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BigCity Deserves Better</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let anyone stand in your way of getting the truth in print. The people deserve to know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative journalist. Each level is inspired by a major historical event from the 1920s including the Black Sox Scandal, Prohibition, and the obscene working conditions that inspired Upton Sinclair's <i>The Jungle.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support Your Leads with Photographic Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and photograph <strong>Secret Photos</strong> to support your story and rack up bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64a0a7cac4485748c93dfe62c594bf63.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique pickups, from the homing Paper Airplane <strong>Flyers</strong> to the shaken <strong>Soda Thrower</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/a4924cb9bab362ac6fbf335fcd109f49.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ink-Slingin' Shutterbug</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out multiple foes at once by hucking jars of <strong>Ink</strong> or stun groups with your <strong>Camera Flash.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/5aaf4960d0f964f5b9c6baf920f3df80.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stand up to the Big Cheeses of BigCity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill against challenging boss fights at the end of every third stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/124c19381e213db1fbd0ceb61e467d8f.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BigCity Deserves Better</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let anyone stand in your way of getting the truth in print. The people deserve to know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.poster.avif?t=1752358623\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.webm?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600210/extras/64f96d17e481a80cfaf86d456ed1bdb4.mp4?t=1752358623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
